#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:14
#: 6db342ad90d24d98a196e2d27ec76a7a 7bd4c47ac957492f8e038cf38aa238b3
#: 9b55dd8455a4495ba0ea9655466ee2c2 9b82f18a2d4d41148f859e3f786d87b6
#: dfd227ea7ca44e98928faf9ccd9a56a5 f2a02a9b99014d59b2a93da6c854a157
msgid ""
"The Cube Purple autopilot is designed for ground based applications such as "
"boat, car or rover. Based on the Cube Black main module the purple is a much"
" smaller platform for applications where sensor redundancy is not required."
msgstr ""
"The Cube Purple 飞控专为船、车或漫游车等地面应用设计。基于 Cube Black 主模块，Purple "
"是一个更小的平台，适用于不需要传感器冗余的应用场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:16
#: 5a74c7aba39a46a0b82233c444e86257 68e516f7f7b0420ab318f7ca96dcec8d
