msgstr "Mini 载板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:42
#: 473d382e25464a4c816c41b4799b2337 59d09e9a9a6f45498eff670eb0a2a696
#: 5f1b4bdf22c94facb656de26397b5fe8 7f957980b49b457a84a9ceba82dc2a58
#: 8c4944cb260a4fad8a975d09abc6361a e5cdee9bedd4427da77e9a813459c981
msgid ""
"Mini Carrier Board has the standardized DF17 connector which allows the user"
" to connect it to every version of the Cube autopilot. With smaller size and"
" almost the same capability with the standard carrier board, it can better "
"fit in to those applications which have size limits. Also, it can be "
"equipped with the Cube Purple to better fulfil the requests from customers."
msgstr ""
"Mini 载板具有标准化的 DF17 连接器，允许用户将其连接到各版本的 Cube "
"飞控。体积更小，功能与标准载板几乎相同，更适合有尺寸限制的应用场景。此外，可与 Cube Purple 搭配使用，以更好地满足客户需求。"

