#: 9efc91c1d4724b418140f435bc94ceaa d4940c51cf874de5840a13e20b2e7395
msgid ""
"Dual power input (for redundant power, automatic switch to another power "
"when one fails) Power distribution (limit the current at each connector, "
"avoiding overloading when one device draws too large current) Voltage "
"protection (over or under voltage protection, the circuit will be shut down "
"if the voltage exceeds the limit)"
msgstr ""
"双路电源输入（冗余供电，一路故障时自动切换至另一路）电源分配（限制每个连接器的电流，防止某个设备抽取过大电流导致过载）电压保护（过压或欠压保护，电压超限时电路将关闭）"

